stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Flat
  Flat --> Pending: signal fires, risk allows
  Pending --> Open: maker fill
  Pending --> Flat: no fill, cancel
  Open --> Winning: mark > entry
  Open --> Underwater: mark < entry
  Winning --> Flat: lock, target, trail
  Underwater --> Underwater: hold-losers rule
  Underwater --> Flat: only if mark >= entry
  Open --> Flat: clock exit (winner only)
